                <pb facs="0364" n="274" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg274"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The British Secretary of State for Foreign
                        Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Balfour</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Ambassador at Washington</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-07-10"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 10, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Czechs at Vladivostok. Instructions have been issued for the British garrison
                    battalion at Hong Kong to proceed immediately to Vladivostok in order to replace
                    the Czechs there, who are starting a movement on Irkutsk.</p>
            </div>
